    "question": {
      ":question/id": "e37f7ae2-7279-5bba-99ee-5944e630b07f",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y = \\csc x$? Assume $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(9π,-1)$ is not on the graph.\n- **II.** The function has a vertical asymptotes at $x = nπ$.\n- **III.** The value $y = 3$ is in the range of the function.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "8dcea918-44a0-5d35-8a9a-b10d25f561c4",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
