          ]
        }
      ],
      ":question/worked-solution": "Cosecant is undefined at 9*pi and at every n*pi, so (9*pi,-1) is not on its graph and those x-values are vertical asymptotes. It takes the value 3 where sin(x)=1/3.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
    },
