      ":question/worked-solution": "Cosecant is undefined at pi and at every n*pi, so (pi,-1) is not on its graph and those x-values are vertical asymptotes. It takes the value 2 where sin(x)=1/2.",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
