    "question": {
      ":question/id": "7f9b6dec-db48-5906-bd24-22a66fbf4edb",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y = \\csc x$? Assume $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The point $(15π,-1)$ is not on the graph.\n- **II.** The function has a vertical asymptotes at $x = nπ$.\n- **III.** The value $y = -3$ is in the range of the function.",
